{"seq":2,"slug":"planning-reliability","title":"长程可靠性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-agent-planning/practice/planning-reliability","wordCount":1559,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"长程可靠性\">长程可靠性</h1><p><a href=\"../foundations/why-planning\">为何需要规划</a>埋下过一个直觉：误差沿步数复利累积，单步 95% 的成功率在二十步后只剩三成多。<a href=\"planning-evaluation\">规划评测</a>又用 pass^k 把这道鸿沟量化了。这一篇把它做成一个可操作的可靠性框架：衰减到底有多快、为什么基准分不能直接换算成生产可靠性、以及有哪些工程手段能把衰减压住。这是把一个能在 demo 里跑通的智能体，变成敢交给真实用户的智能体，最硬的一道关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>长程可靠性指智能体在多步、长时任务上稳定达成目标的能力。它的核心敌人是<strong>误差复利（error compounding）</strong>：每一步都有失败概率，而长任务要求步步不踏空，于是失败概率沿步数累积放大。</p>\n<p>最简模型：设各步独立、单步成功率均为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 步任务全程成功的概率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>success</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{success}}(n) = p^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">success</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9088em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个指数衰减的残酷在于它对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 极其敏感。下表给出几组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 在不同步数下的全程成功率，触目惊心：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单步成功率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>5 步</th>\n<th>10 步</th>\n<th>20 步</th>\n<th>50 步</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0.99</td>\n<td>95%</td>\n<td>90%</td>\n<td>82%</td>\n<td>61%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.95</td>\n<td>77%</td>\n<td>60%</td>\n<td>36%</td>\n<td>8%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.90</td>\n<td>59%</td>\n<td>35%</td>\n<td>12%</td>\n<td>0.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.80</td>\n<td>33%</td>\n<td>11%</td>\n<td>1%</td>\n<td>~0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>读这张表能纠正一个普遍误判：把单步从 90% 提到 95% 看似只是&quot;小改进&quot;，但在 20 步任务上把成功率从 12% 抬到 36%——翻了三倍。<strong>可靠性工程的杠杆在单步质量上，是非线性的</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P[单步成功率 p] --&gt; POW[全程成功率 = p 的 n 次方]&#10;    POW --&gt; DECAY[随步数 n 指数衰减]&#10;    DECAY --&gt; M1[手段1: 提高单步 p&lt;br/&gt;非线性收益]&#10;    DECAY --&gt; M2[手段2: 减少步数 n&lt;br/&gt;分解+技能库]&#10;    DECAY --&gt; M3[手段3: 打破独立假设&lt;br/&gt;校验点+重试]&#10;    M1 --&gt; REL[长程可靠]&#10;    M2 --&gt; REL&#10;    M3 --&gt; REL\">flowchart TD\n    P[单步成功率 p] --&gt; POW[全程成功率 = p 的 n 次方]\n    POW --&gt; DECAY[随步数 n 指数衰减]\n    DECAY --&gt; M1[手段1: 提高单步 p&lt;br/&gt;非线性收益]\n    DECAY --&gt; M2[手段2: 减少步数 n&lt;br/&gt;分解+技能库]\n    DECAY --&gt; M3[手段3: 打破独立假设&lt;br/&gt;校验点+重试]\n    M1 --&gt; REL[长程可靠]\n    M2 --&gt; REL\n    M3 --&gt; REL</pre><h2 id=\"基准分不能直接换算成生产可靠性\">基准分不能直接换算成生产可靠性</h2><p>不存在「基准 90 分必然等于生产 70 分」这样的通用换算。基准分是模型、脚手架、任务分布、资源预算和判定器共同产生的条件结果；换一个工具版本、网站状态或用户表达，成功率就可能变化。</p>\n<p>生产落差通常来自三处叠加：(1) 单次平均成功率没有暴露重复运行的一致性；(2) 基准任务往往比真实任务短、边界更清楚；(3) 真实环境有版本漂移、限流、超时、脏数据和权限差异。正确做法不是给基准分乘一个拍脑袋折扣，而是在与生产相同的脚手架上按任务长度、风险和环境噪声分层回放，并同时报告 <code>pass^k</code>、成本、时延与副作用错误率。</p>\n<p>METR 的 50%/80% 时间视界提供了一个比平均分更有解释力的长度视角：按人类专家完成任务所需时间分桶，再拟合智能体成功概率随任务难度的变化。它能告诉你可靠性从哪个任务长度开始明显坍塌，但仍受任务域限制，不能从软件工程自动外推到商务流程或开放世界行动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条压制衰减的工程杠杆\">三条压制衰减的工程杠杆</h2><p>既然敌人是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，缓解就从这个式子的三个变量下手。</p>\n<p><strong>杠杆一：提高单步成功率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。</strong> 如上所述收益非线性。手段包括更强的模型、更好的提示、给关键步骤加<a href=\"../adaptation/reflection-self-critique\">反思</a>校准。这是最直接但也最受模型能力天花板限制的一条。</p>\n<p><strong>杠杆二：减少有效步数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。</strong> 步数越少，复利空间越小。<a href=\"../paradigms/task-decomposition\">任务分解</a>把任务结构化、<a href=\"../adaptation/planning-memory\">技能库</a>把多步固化成一个高层动作，都在压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。ReWOO 把工具调用并行化也间接降低了&quot;串行步数&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>杠杆三：打破&quot;各步独立&quot;假设。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成立的前提是失败不可恢复且各步独立。在每步后插入<strong>校验点（checkpoint）</strong> 和<strong>重试</strong>，就把一个会失败的步骤变成&quot;多次机会&quot;，等效单步成功率升到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>r</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-(1-p)^r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试）。这正是<a href=\"../adaptation/replanning-recovery\">重规划与恢复</a>的用武之地。</p>\n<p>下表把三条杠杆与具体技术对应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>杠杆</th>\n<th>数学效果</th>\n<th>具体技术</th>\n<th>主讲篇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>底数变大</td>\n<td>反思校准、更强模型、主动校验</td>\n<td><a href=\"../adaptation/reflection-self-critique\">反思</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>指数变小</td>\n<td>分解、技能库、并行化</td>\n<td><a href=\"../paradigms/task-decomposition\">任务分解</a>、<a href=\"../adaptation/planning-memory\">规划与记忆</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>破独立假设</td>\n<td>单步可重试</td>\n<td>校验点、重试退避、子目标隔离</td>\n<td><a href=\"../adaptation/replanning-recovery\">重规划与恢复</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"子目标隔离与幂等-让失败不扩散\">子目标隔离与幂等：让失败不扩散</h2><p>第三条杠杆里有两个工程原语值得单独讲，它们决定了失败会不会&quot;扩散&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>子目标隔离（subgoal isolation）</strong>：把长任务切成若干独立的检查段，每段完成即固化（持久化中间结果），后续段失败不会污染已完成段。这样重试只需从最近检查点开始，而非从头。它把一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 步任务的失败半径从&quot;全程&quot;缩到&quot;一段&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>幂等（idempotency）</strong>：让动作可安全重复执行而不产生副作用——重试&quot;订票&quot;不会订成两张。没有幂等，重试本身就是新的风险源。对涉及金钱、外发、删除的动作，幂等是重试的前提，否则只能升级到<a href=\"human-in-the-loop-planning\">人在回路</a>而不能自动重试。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 子目标隔离 + 幂等重试的骨架&#10;def run_long_task(subgoals):&#10;    checkpoint = load_checkpoint()          # 从已完成处续跑, 不从头&#10;    for sg in subgoals[checkpoint.idx:]:&#10;        for attempt in range(MAX_RETRY):&#10;            if sg.is_done(checkpoint):      # 幂等检查: 已做过就跳过&#10;                break&#10;            ok = execute_idempotent(sg)     # 幂等执行, 重试安全&#10;            if ok:&#10;                save_checkpoint(sg)         # 固化, 失败不回退此段&#10;                break&#10;        else:&#10;            return escalate(sg)             # 重试耗尽, 升级求助\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 子目标隔离 + 幂等重试的骨架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> run_long_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(subgoals):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    checkpoint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_checkpoint()          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从已完成处续跑, 不从头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subgoals[checkpoint.idx:]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MAX_RETRY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sg.is_done(checkpoint):      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 幂等检查: 已做过就跳过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> execute_idempotent(sg)     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 幂等执行, 重试安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ok:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                save_checkpoint(sg)         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 固化, 失败不回退此段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> escalate(sg)             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 重试耗尽, 升级求助</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这套&quot;隔离+幂等+有界重试+超限升级&quot;是 2026 年长程智能体的标准可靠性骨架，也是<a href=\"../adaptation/replanning-recovery\">重规划</a>护栏在可靠性视角下的复述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>长程可靠性的核心敌人是误差复利 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=p^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，指数衰减对单步成功率极敏感：把单步 0.90 提到 0.95，20 步任务成功率从 12% 翻到 36%——可靠性杠杆在单步质量上且非线性。</li>\n<li>基准分不能直接换算成生产可靠性；应在同脚手架上按任务长度、风险与环境噪声分层回放，报告一致成功、成本、时延和副作用错误。</li>\n<li>三条压制衰减的杠杆：提高单步 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、减少步数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、打破各步独立假设（校验点+重试把单步变多次机会）。</li>\n<li>子目标隔离把失败半径从全程缩到一段，幂等让重试安全；二者加有界重试与超限升级，是 2026 年标准可靠性骨架。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇（量化指标）：<a href=\"planning-evaluation\">规划评测</a>；同章下一篇（重试耗尽后）：<a href=\"human-in-the-loop-planning\">人在回路规划</a>。</li>\n<li>直觉起点：<a href=\"../foundations/why-planning\">为何需要规划</a>。</li>\n<li>三条杠杆的主讲篇：<a href=\"../paradigms/task-decomposition\">任务分解</a>、<a href=\"../adaptation/reflection-self-critique\">反思与自我批评</a>、<a href=\"../adaptation/replanning-recovery\">重规划与恢复</a>、<a href=\"../adaptation/planning-memory\">规划与记忆</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"长程可靠性","id":"长程可靠性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基准分不能直接换算成生产可靠性","id":"基准分不能直接换算成生产可靠性"},{"level":2,"text":"三条压制衰减的工程杠杆","id":"三条压制衰减的工程杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"子目标隔离与幂等：让失败不扩散","id":"子目标隔离与幂等-让失败不扩散"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"规划评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-agent-planning/practice/planning-evaluation"},"next":{"title":"人在回路规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-agent-planning/practice/human-in-the-loop-planning"}}